  <!-- EN: body modder pleased -->
  <ProsthophileHappy.stages.body_modder_pleased.label>modder do corpo satisfeito</ProsthophileHappy.stages.body_modder_pleased.label>
  <!-- EN: This artificial enhancement is cool. I want more. -->
  <ProsthophileHappy.stages.body_modder_pleased.description>Este realce artificial é legal. Quero mais.</ProsthophileHappy.stages.body_modder_pleased.description>
  <!-- EN: body modder quite pleased -->
  <ProsthophileHappy.stages.body_modder_quite_pleased.label>modder corpo bastante satisfeito</ProsthophileHappy.stages.body_modder_quite_pleased.label>
  <!-- EN: Two artificial enhancements are better than one. I wish I had more. -->
  <ProsthophileHappy.stages.body_modder_quite_pleased.description>Dois aprimoramentos artificiais são melhores que um. Quem me dera ter mais.</ProsthophileHappy.stages.body_modder_quite_pleased.description>
  <!-- EN: body modder delighted -->
  <ProsthophileHappy.stages.body_modder_delighted.label>modder do corpo encantado</ProsthophileHappy.stages.body_modder_delighted.label>
  <!-- EN: Three artificial enhancements, and my weak human flesh is receding. But I still want more machine power. -->
  <ProsthophileHappy.stages.body_modder_delighted.description>Três melhorias artificiais, e a minha carne humana fraca está a retroceder. Mas ainda quero mais energia da máquina.</ProsthophileHappy.stages.body_modder_delighted.description>
  <!-- EN: body modder enchanted -->
  <ProsthophileHappy.stages.body_modder_enchanted.label>modder do corpo encantado</ProsthophileHappy.stages.body_modder_enchanted.label>
  <!-- EN: Four artificial enhancements and I am becoming more than human. But there's still some flesh that needs replacing. -->
  <ProsthophileHappy.stages.body_modder_enchanted.description>Quatro melhorias artificiais e eu estou me tornando mais do que humano. Mas ainda há carne que precisa de ser substituída.</ProsthophileHappy.stages.body_modder_enchanted.description>
  <!-- EN: body modder overjoyed -->
  <ProsthophileHappy.stages.body_modder_overjoyed.label>modder do corpo overjoyed</ProsthophileHappy.stages.body_modder_overjoyed.label>
  <!-- EN: Five artificial enhancements! How could an enhanced being like me ever feel sad? -->
  <ProsthophileHappy.stages.body_modder_overjoyed.description>Cinco melhorias artificiais! Como pode um ser melhorado como eu sentir-se triste?</ProsthophileHappy.stages.body_modder_overjoyed.description>
  <!-- EN: machine body is complete -->
  <ProsthophileHappy.stages.machine_body_is_complete.label>corpo da máquina é completa</ProsthophileHappy.stages.machine_body_is_complete.label>
  <!-- EN: I asked for this. -->
  <ProsthophileHappy.stages.machine_body_is_complete.description>Pedi isto.</ProsthophileHappy.stages.machine_body_is_complete.description>
  <!-- EN: body modder frustrated -->
  <ProsthophileNoProsthetic.stages.body_modder_frustrated.label>modder do corpo frustrado</ProsthophileNoProsthetic.stages.body_modder_frustrated.label>
  <!-- EN: Flesh is so limiting. I wish I had some kind of artificial body part. -->
  <ProsthophileNoProsthetic.stages.body_modder_frustrated.description>O Flesh é tão limitador. Quem me dera ter uma parte artificial do corpo.</ProsthophileNoProsthetic.stages.body_modder_frustrated.description>
  <!-- EN: body purist squeamish -->
  <ProsthophobeUnhappy.stages.body_purist_squeamish.label>corpo purista squeamish</ProsthophobeUnhappy.stages.body_purist_squeamish.label>
  <!-- EN: I hate having this unnatural enhancement. I feel filthy! -->
  <ProsthophobeUnhappy.stages.body_purist_squeamish.description>Detesto ter este realce não natural. Sinto-me imundo!</ProsthophobeUnhappy.stages.body_purist_squeamish.description>
  <!-- EN: body purist disgusted -->
  <ProsthophobeUnhappy.stages.body_purist_disgusted.label>corpo purista nojento</ProsthophobeUnhappy.stages.body_purist_disgusted.label>
  <!-- EN: Two artificial enhancements are sullying my natural, pure body. It makes me sick to think of it. -->
  <ProsthophobeUnhappy.stages.body_purist_disgusted.description>Dois aprimoramentos artificiais estão sulcando meu corpo natural e puro. Deixa-me doente para pensar nisso.</ProsthophobeUnhappy.stages.body_purist_disgusted.description>
  <!-- EN: body purist violated -->
  <ProsthophobeUnhappy.stages.body_purist_violated.label>purista de corpo violado</ProsthophobeUnhappy.stages.body_purist_violated.label>
  <!-- EN: Three artificial enhancements violate my body's pure flesh. I shudder when I think of it... and these objects shudder with me. -->
  <ProsthophobeUnhappy.stages.body_purist_violated.description>Três melhorias artificiais violam a carne pura do meu corpo. Eu encolhe quando penso nisso... e estes objectos encolhem comigo.</ProsthophobeUnhappy.stages.body_purist_violated.description>
  <!-- EN: body purist horrified -->
  <ProsthophobeUnhappy.stages.body_purist_horrified.label>corpo purista horrorizado</ProsthophobeUnhappy.stages.body_purist_horrified.label>
  <!-- EN: I have four artificial enhancements; it's like I'm becoming a robot. What a horrifying sensation. -->
  <ProsthophobeUnhappy.stages.body_purist_horrified.description>Tenho quatro aprimoramentos artificiais; é como se estivesse me tornando um robô. Que sensação horrível.</ProsthophobeUnhappy.stages.body_purist_horrified.description>
  <!-- EN: body purist nightmare -->
  <ProsthophobeUnhappy.stages.body_purist_nightmare.label>corpo purista pesadelo</ProsthophobeUnhappy.stages.body_purist_nightmare.label>
  <!-- EN: Five artificial enhancements... Is there anything left of me? Or am I just a robot that thinks it's human? -->
  <ProsthophobeUnhappy.stages.body_purist_nightmare.description>Cinco melhorias artificiais... Ainda me resta alguma coisa? Ou sou apenas um robô que pensa que é humano?</ProsthophobeUnhappy.stages.body_purist_nightmare.description>
  <!-- EN: I have become what I hate -->
  <ProsthophobeUnhappy.stages.I_have_become_what_I_hate.label>Eu me tornei o que odeio</ProsthophobeUnhappy.stages.I_have_become_what_I_hate.label>
  <!-- EN: I asked for the exact opposite of this! -->
  <ProsthophobeUnhappy.stages.I_have_become_what_I_hate.description>Pedi exactamente o oposto disto!</ProsthophobeUnhappy.stages.I_have_become_what_I_hate.description>
  <!-- EN: pyromaniac has incendiary weapon -->
  <PyromaniacHappy.stages.pyromaniac_has_incendiary_weapon.label>pyromaniac tem arma incendiária</PyromaniacHappy.stages.pyromaniac_has_incendiary_weapon.label>
  <!-- EN: It makes me think of flame and fire. I can't wait to use it. -->
  <PyromaniacHappy.stages.pyromaniac_has_incendiary_weapon.description>Faz-me pensar em chama e fogo. Mal posso esperar para o usar.</PyromaniacHappy.stages.pyromaniac_has_incendiary_weapon.description>
